UPDATE companies SET description='Branded Screen Printing & Embroidery was founded in 2009 in Reno, Nevada. The company is locally owned and operated, and its shop is based on Moana Lane in Reno. From the start, the focus has been on making custom apparel easier for local businesses, schools, teams, and events.

