UPDATE companies SET description='Bright Eye Solar is a locally owned solar installation company based in Lancaster, Pennsylvania. Founded in 2010 by Jim Noden, who serves as owner and CEO, the firm began as a full-service provider handling energy audits, system design, permitting, and installation for homeowners and businesses across Lancaster County and surrounding regions, as well as Maryland and New Jersey.

The company designs and installs custom solar panel systems for residential and commercial properties, including rooftop and ground‑mounted arrays, and integrates battery storage solutions. It also provides ongoing maintenance and repair services. To date, Bright Eye Solar has completed over 1,600 installations, avoiding approximately 12,000 metric tons of CO₂ annually and saving customers an estimated $2.8 million per year.

Bright Eye Solar serves residential homeowners and commercial businesses throughout Pennsylvania, Maryland, and New Jersey. Its commercial work focuses on helping companies reduce utility bills and improve sustainability, while residential projects aim to lower electric bills and increase energy independence. The company also assists clients with financing options and securing federal, state, and local incentives.

