UPDATE companies SET description='Brilliant Solar, operating as Brilliant Installations, is based in Toms River, New Jersey. The company was founded in 2017 by Michael Piompino, a solar industry veteran who had been working in the field since 2010. Piompino launched the business to provide end-to-end solar solutions for homeowners and businesses in the region.

The firm specializes in turnkey solar installations, including rooftop and ground-mount arrays, and supplements that work with in-house roofing, tree removal, and electrical services. Its NABCEP-certified installers and electricians handle everything from site assessment and engineering through permitting, installation, and final inspection. The company also arranges financing and backs its systems with production guarantees and bumper-to-bumper warranties.

