UPDATE companies SET description='Butterfield Foods LLC operates from Noblesville, Indiana, as a family-owned and operated custom food producer. The company emphasizes its family-owned culture and direct access to ownership, with one employee noting the ability to walk 30 feet to talk to the owner.

The 60,000-square-foot plant houses capabilities including steam-jacketed kettles, steam and convection ovens, spiral freezers, nitrogen tunnels, and high-speed sandwich lines. The company produces soups, sauces, sandwiches, cooked proteins, quesadillas, burritos, and retail entrees, offering services such as recipe commercialization, nutritional analysis, hand assembly, and modified atmosphere packaging in flexible pouches (2–8 lbs) and PET, CPET, or aluminum trays (10 oz–5 lbs). It also provides gluten-free, halal, and kosher assembly.

Its SQF 2000 Level 3 certification, USDA inspection, and HACCP compliance support customers requiring rigorous food-safety standards, including those needing gluten-free, halal, or kosher production.

The company differentiates itself through a culture of dependability—targeting on-time, defect-free delivery—and culinary integrity led by a Certified Research Chef and a Culinary Institute of America graduate. Management chose the highest GFSI standard (SQF Level 3) in 2011 and maintains on-site microbiological testing to reinforce food safety.', certifications=ARRAY['SQF 2000 Level 3','HACCP','USDA inspected']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Steam-jacketed kettle cooking", "Steam and convection oven cooking", "Spiral freezing", "Nitrogen tunnel freezing", "High-speed sandwich line assembly", "Hand assembly", "Recipe commercialization", "Nutritional analysis", "Flexible pouch packaging (2\u20138 lbs)", "PET tray packaging (10 oz\u20135 lbs)", "CPET tray packaging (10 oz\u20135 lbs)", "Aluminum tray packaging (10 oz\u20135 lbs)", "Modified atmosphere packaging", "Gluten-free assembly", "Halal assembly", "Kosher assembly", "Custom food production", "Co-manufacturing", "Soups production", "Sauces production", "Sandwich assembly", "Cooked protein processing", "Quesadilla assembly", "Burrito assembly", "Retail entree production"], "industries": ["Food manufacturing", "Co-packing", "Retail food", "Food service"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Steam-jacketed kettles", "Steam and convection ovens", "Spiral freezer", "Nitrogen tunnels", "High-speed sandwich lines"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "3 weeks for items in regular production", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["SQF 2000 Level 3 certification (GFSI highest standard)", "USDA inspected and HACCP certified with on-site microbiological testing", "Family-owned, medium-sized operation with direct owner access", "Certified Research Chef and Culinary Institute of America graduate leading product development", "Recipe commercialization, nutritional analysis, and flexible packaging options (pouches, trays, MAP)"], "facts_used": ["Family-owned and operated -> /", "60,000 Square Foot Plant -> /", "SQF 2000 Level 3 Certified 