UPDATE companies SET description='C & C Manufacturing Inc. operates from Gaithersburg, Maryland, where the business traces its roots to 1974. Boyhood friends Ron Crupi and Scott Campbell formed a partnership to build custom trailers and towing components, launching the Mastertrack brand. In 2012, Dawn Crupi, daughter of one founder, established C & C Manufacturing Inc.

The company manufactures the Mastertrack line of trailers — including dump, enclosed, landscape, and equipment models — and maintains a rotating inventory of new and used units. Its shop provides full-service trailer repair, custom fabrication, steel and aluminum welding, electrical work, and Maryland-authorized state and DOT inspections. An in-stock parts department supplies axles, brakes, suspensions, tires, wheels, lighting, cargo hardware, and Dexter Axle components, while the team also installs hitches, gooseneck and fifth-wheel systems, tow-vehicle wiring, and brake controllers.

Customers range from federal agencies such as NASA, the U.S. Navy, the U.S. Army, and the White House to commercial haulers, landscapers, construction firms, and individual trailer owners. The business serves both government contracts and the retail market, offering sales, service, and inspection for a wide variety of towing needs.

From the start, the founders emphasized quality over volume, choosing to build trailers one at a time rather than pursue large-scale expansion. That philosophy remains central: the company states that superior trailers result from focused, piece-by-piece fabrication and a commitment to fast turnaround on repairs.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Trailer repair", "Custom fabrication", "Steel welding", "Aluminum welding", "Trailer inspection (Maryland state, DOT)", "Hitch installation (gooseneck, fifth wheel)", "Tow vehicle wiring installation", "Brake controller installation", "Trailer parts sales (axles, brakes, suspensions, tires, wheels, body components, lighting, cargo control)", "Trailer maintenance (redecking)", "Electrical services", "Trailer manufacturing (Mastertrack line)", "New and used trailer sales", "Inventory management (rotating stock)"], "industries": ["Government/Military (NASA, U.S. Navy, U.S. Army, White House)", "Commercial transportation", "Landscaping", "Construction", "Residential hauling"], "materials": ["Steel", "Aluminum"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Trailers built one at a time to maintain quality", "Authorized Maryland state and DOT trailer inspection station", "Custom steel and aluminum fabrication of trailer accessories", "Fast turnaround on trailer repairs", "In-stock parts department with rotating new and used trailer inventory"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1974 -> db", "Headquarters Gaithersburg, MD -> db", "Founders Ron Crupi and Scott Campbell -> /", "Dawn Crupi started C&C Manufacturing Inc in 2012 -> /", "Produces Mastertrack Trailer line -> /", "Offers trailer repair, custom fabrication, welding -> /", "Serves NASA, US Navy, US Army, White House -> /", "Authorized MD State Trailer Inspections -> /", "Steel and aluminum welding -> /", "In-stock parts department -> /", "Fast turnaround on repairs -> /", "Quality first, built one at a time -> /", "Custom