UPDATE companies SET description='C & G Custom Woodworks operates from Millbrook, Alabama, as a small custom woodworking shop. The founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed, nor are the founders named in available sources. The business presents itself as a hands-on operation emphasizing craftsmanship and personal attention.

