UPDATE companies SET description='C-K Plastics, Inc. operates from St. Louis, Missouri, where it was founded in 1978. The company was acquired by Technical Industries in 2011 and continues to operate as a manufacturer of custom thermoplastic parts. From its start, the firm focused on challenging products that other manufacturers avoided, such as large-diameter profile extrusions and complex blow-molded shapes requiring specialized tooling.

