UPDATE companies SET description='CED Central Ohio operates as a branch of Consolidated Electrical Distributors (CED), a national network with more than 700 locations across the United States. The company serves the Columbus, Ohio region from two facilities in Columbus and Newark, covering a service area that stretches from Mansfield to Cincinnati and includes Franklin, Licking, Delaware, Fairfield, and surrounding counties.

