UPDATE companies SET description='CMC Foods, Inc. is headquartered in Kansas City, Missouri, with additional facilities in Hot Springs, Arkansas, and Atlanta, Georgia. The company specializes in the procurement, packaging, and distribution of edible oils, vinegars, and cooking wines.

