UPDATE companies SET description='CO Lumber & Real Wood Furniture operates from Colorado Springs, Colorado, where it was founded in 1981 as a modest unfinished furniture store with a one‑person woodworking shop. The business has remained locally owned and operated throughout its history, expanding in 2001 by joining forces with Rocky Mountain Cabinets, a fellow Colorado Springs cabinet maker that shared its focus on craftsmanship and customer satisfaction.

Today the company functions as both a major hardwood retailer and a custom woodworking facility, describing itself as one of the largest such operations in El Paso County. Its shop produces custom cabinetry, architectural millwork, live‑edge slab furniture, and other made‑to‑order wood products, while its showroom and lumber yard stock domestic and exotic hardwoods, softwoods, plywood, mouldings, and a wide selection of finished and unfinished furniture, including Amish‑crafted pieces. The facility also offers a complimentary cut‑to‑size service on sheet goods.

The customer base spans homeowners, contractors, woodworkers, builders, remodelers, interior designers, and craftsmen. Builders and remodelers source cabinetry and millwork for residential projects; woodworkers and hobbyists purchase lumber, plywood, and live‑edge slabs for custom projects; and homeowners buy finished furniture or commission bespoke pieces. The company notes that its custom woodworking shop serves enthusiasts, homeowners needing specific furniture, and businesses seeking unique pieces for their spaces.

The founding mission — to build quality products and ensure every customer receives exactly what they envisioned — remains the stated differentiator. Leadership emphasizes that owner‑operated status allows personalized attention, expert guidance, and a commitment to craftsmanship that has earned the trust of the local building and woodworking community over four decades.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom woodworking", "Custom cabinetry", "Architectural millwork", "Live edge slab fabrication", "Furniture manufacturing", "Custom millwork", "Lumber cutting (free cut per sheet)", "Moulding supply"], "industries": ["Residential construction", "Commercial construction", "Woodworking", "Interior design", "Furniture manufacturing", "Cabinet making", "Remodeling"], "materials": ["Domestic hardwoods", "Exotic hardwoods", "Softwoods", "Plywood", "Live edge slabs (Monkey Pod)", "Baltic Birch", "Mouldings"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Owner\u2011operated for personalized customer attention", "Free cut\u2011to\u2011size service on sheet goods (one cut per sheet)", "Extensive in\u2011house moulding selection", "Custom woodworking, cabinetry, and architectural millwork capabilities", "Large inventory of domestic and exotic hardwoods, live\u2011edge slabs, and plywood"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1981 -> /about-us", "Started as unfinished furniture store with one-person woodworking shop -> /about-us", "Joined forces with Rocky Mountain Cabinets in 2001 -> /about-us", "Locally owned and operated -> /about-us, /", "One of the largest hardwood retailers and custom woodworking facilities in El Paso County -> /about-us", "Offers custom cabinetry, architectural millwork, live-edge slabs, premium hardwoods, cabinetry lines -> /about-us", "Custom woodworking shop serves enthusiasts, homeowners, businesses -> /", "Products: finished furniture, unfinished furniture, Amish furniture, cabinets, live edge sl