UPDATE companies SET description='CTAC Solutions, based in Aurora, Colorado, has served the Denver metropolitan area since 1996. Founded as Colorado Telephone and Cable, the family-owned, minority- and women-owned business rebranded in 2024 to reflect its expanded portfolio. The company is led by Eric Williams, who serves as engineer and CEO, alongside lead field engineer Nathan Williams and administrator Tamara Williams.

The firm delivers end-to-end telecommunications and IT infrastructure services. As an authorized Avaya partner since the brand''s inception, it designs and installs business phone systems ranging from traditional voice to advanced VoIP platforms. Its low-voltage division handles structured cabling — including Cat6 and Cat6A — for voice, data, audio, and video across commercial buildings. A partnership with Uniview supplies surveillance cameras, DVRs, and NVRs with remote monitoring via desktop and mobile apps. Additional offerings include telephone system management, carrier optimization, network connectivity planning, IoT device management, and technology consulting. The team reports more than 1,000 completed projects and over 500 clients across 25-plus years.

Clients span small startups to large enterprises throughout the Denver metro region, including Centennial, Littleton, Westminster, Boulder, and Parker. The company also supports individual customers and has assisted telecom technicians in other states with troubleshooting. Long-term relationships are common; one client cited over 20 years of continuous service for telephone equipment and repair.

CTAC Solutions emphasizes a customer-centric model that promises direct human support without automated phone trees. The 2024 rebrand marked a shift from a traditional telecom provider to a full-spectrum solutions partner, aiming to deliver scalable, future-ready technology with minimal disruption during installation and maintenance.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Avaya phone system installation and management", "VoIP phone system deployment", "Structured cabling (Cat6, Cat6A)", "Low-voltage wiring for voice, data, audio, video", "Security camera installation (Uniview DVR/NVR)", "Access control system installation", "Telephone system management and auditing", "Carrier optimization and cost reduction", "Network connectivity design and implementation", "IoT device management and monitoring", "Technology consulting", "Infrastructure design and installation"], "industries": ["Telecommunications", "Information Technology", "Physical Security", "Commercial Construction", "Business Services"], "materials": ["Cat6 cable", "Cat6A cable", "Low-voltage copper wiring"], "equipment": ["Avaya phone systems", "Uniview cameras", "Uniview DVRs", "Uniview NVRs"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Authorized Avaya business partner since the brand''s inception", "Uniview partnership for surveillance cameras, DVRs, and NVRs with remote monitoring", "Family-owned, minority- and women-owned business", "25+ years serving the Denver metro area", "Free site walk and transparent, robot-free support"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters Aurora, Colorado -> db", "Founded 1996 -> /about", "Family-owned, minority- and women-owned -> /about", "Leadership: Eric Williams (Engineer + CEO), Nathan Williams (Lead Field Engineer), Tamara Williams (Administrator) -> /about", "Rebranded to CTAC Solutions in 2024 -> /about", "Authorized Avaya dealer since inception -> /services", "Structured cabling Cat6, Cat6A, low-voltage wiring -> /services", "Uniview partnership for cameras, DVRs, NVRs -> /services", "Services: telephone management, carrier optimization, network connectivity, IoT, consulting -> /services", "1000+ projects, 500+ clients, 25+ years experience -> /about", "Service area: Denver metro including Centennial, Littleton, Westminster, Boulder, Parker -> /", "Client testimonials: 20+ year relationship, remote technician support -> /"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "We install all types of low voltage wiring (voice, data, audio and video wire).", "founded_year": "1996", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned", "Minority-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='ctac-solutions-colorado-telephone-and-cable' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
