UPDATE companies SET description='Cable Connection Inc., a BizLink Company, operates from Fremont, California. Founded in 1996 in Los Gatos, the business began as a custom cable assembly supplier and later acquired Wilco Wire Technology, moving its headquarters to Fremont. The company is a subsidiary of BizLink Technology Inc.

