UPDATE companies SET description='Cablecom, Inc. was incorporated in May 1986 in Wichita, Kansas, and has remained locally owned and operated. The company established itself in the heart of the city’s Old Town district, moving to its current location at 800 East 3rd Street in 2007, a building listed on the National Register of Historic Places.

The firm designs and installs voice, data, fiber, audio-visual, and surveillance infrastructures. Its core services include structured cabling certified to BICSI standards with manufacturers’ warranties, fiber optic installation (added in 1991), network video surveillance systems, audio-visual system design, installation, and equipment rentals, and access control solutions.

The company does not publish a specific industry list or named customer references in its public materials.

