UPDATE companies SET description='Cal Manufacturing, Inc. operates from Vicksburg, Michigan. The woman-owned company has over 50 years of experience in resistance welding technologies, though a specific founding year is not publicly stated. Cheryl Benson serves on the board of trustees overseeing daily operations, sales, and marketing, while Russ Hayward manages the plant with a background in welding and millwright work.

The company manufactures a range of resistance welding products including air-cooled and water-cooled jumpers, dual-conductor "Kickless" cables, the patented Swivel King kickless cable, induction furnace cables, and copper laminated shunts. It also produces cable adapters, busbars, and water-cooled cable adapters using CNC machining for higher tolerances. Additional services include cable repair and rebuilding, recycling, and custom cable design for robotic welding applications.

Cal Manufacturing serves the automotive industry, supplying OEMs, distributors, and Tier I, II, and III companies, with a growing presence in Mexico for export. Its products are also used in the broader resistance welding and robotics welding markets, where the company emphasizes industrial cable management to reduce failure rates.

The company differentiates itself through expedited shipping programs offering same-day or next-day delivery on stocked items, a patented Swivel King cable that allows 180-degree rotation with minimal force, and a commitment to inspecting and testing every product before shipment. Founded on the principle of being a complete cable supplier, Cal Manufacturing aims to turn customer emergencies into its own priority.', certifications=ARRAY['Woman-owned']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Cable repair and rebuilding", "Recycling services", "CNC machining", "Custom cable design", "Industrial cable management", "Robotic cable management", "Electrode design and production", "Copper laminated shunt fabrication", "Shank and gun arm fabrication", "Cable adapter manufacturing", "Busbar manufacturing", "Water-cooled cable adapter manufacturing", "Expedited shipping programs", "Quality inspection and testing"], "industries": ["Automotive", "Resistance welding", "Robotics welding", "Industrial manufacturing"], "materials": ["Copper"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Same day or next day for stocked parts; expedited programs for same day or two day shipping", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Same-day or next-day shipping on stocked parts", "Expedited delivery programs for same-day or two-day turnaround", "Patented Swivel King cable for robotic welding (180\u00b0 twist with 15 lbs pressure)", "Cable repair and rebuilding service with recycling", "Woman-owned with over 50 years in resistance welding"], "facts_used": ["Location: Vicksburg, Michigan -> /", "Woman-owned certification -> db", "Over 50 years experience in resistance welding technologies -> /", "Products: air-cooled jumpers, water-cooled jumpers, dual-conductor kickless cables, Swivel King kickless cables, induction furnace cables, copper laminated shunts -> /", "CNC machining for higher tolerances -> /", "Cable repair and rebuilding service, recycling services -> /", "Expedited shipping: same day or next d