UPDATE companies SET description='California Plastix operates from Pomona, California, where it produces custom poly bags and polyethylene film for a national customer base. The company was founded on the principle of delivering reliable, American-made packaging with the flexibility to meet any specification, though a specific founding year is not publicly disclosed.

