UPDATE companies SET description='Campofrio Food Group America, headquartered in South Chesterfield, Virginia, operates as the U.S. arm of Sigma Foods, a multinational food company that produces, markets, and distributes cold meats, cured meats, dairy products, and other food items across Mexico, Europe, the United States, and Latin America.

Its portfolio spans over 100 brands, 16 of which generate net sales exceeding US$100 million each. Core operations include meat curing, cold-cut processing, dairy manufacturing, and a resilient supply chain that supports large-scale distribution.

