UPDATE companies SET description='Carolina Products Inc. is based in Charlotte, North Carolina, and was established in 1969. The company is 100% employee-owned, a structure highlighted as a core differentiator. While the founders are not named in available sources, the business has operated continuously for over five decades, building a reputation around custom building control systems and unitized switchgear.

The company designs and manufactures custom panel solutions, building control and automation systems, standard control panels, electrical control systems, and fuel pump and dispenser control systems. Its flagship offering integrates unitized switchgear with building controls in a single package, aimed at reducing construction time and material costs.

Carolina Products serves retail, convenience and grocery stores, restaurants, commercial facilities, and industrial facilities. A cited client, Robinson Oil Corporation, reported significant energy savings after installing a CPI system, illustrating the practical impact in convenience-store and fuel-retail environments.

